WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.875
Raw Drive Rush approaches the recovering Ryu.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:01.500
Ryu blocks the delayed standing heavy kick.

3
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:01.875
Luke backs away as Ryu reaches for a throw.

4
00:00:01.875 --> 00:00:02.875
Crouching medium punch catches the missed throw as Punish Counter.

5
00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:04.125
The standing-medium target sequence continues the punish.

6
00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:05.350
The final medium target hit knocks Ryu down.
